# Weekday names that are also feminine ordinals: segunda (2nd), quarta (4th),
# quinta (5th), sexta (6th).  Priberam s.v. "segunda"
# (https://dicionario.priberam.org/segunda): the ordinal "segundo" is "Que ou
# o que está logo depois do primeiro", and the noun "segunda" is "Dia da
# semana, depois de domingo e antes de terça-feira".  "terça" is not listed:
# the ordinal is "terceira", and "terça" names a fraction only before
# "parte" (see marker_weekday_fraction_homonym.voc).  The weekday reading is
# vetoed only before an ordinal noun (see marker_ordinal_noun.voc).
segunda
quarta
quinta
sexta
